02)--DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]
03)--ProjectionExec: expr=[count(Int64(1))@0 as count(*)]
04)----AggregateExec: mode=Single, gby=[], aggr=[count(Int64(1))]
05)------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(k@0, k@0)], projection=[]
06)--------DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[13]
07)--------MaterializedCteScanExec: name=c

